    "media:imagetext": "British\nairways\nOctober 31, 1982 to March 31, 1983\nConcorde\nSchedule\nFlt.\nBA188 BA192 BA194\nNo.\nW, F,\nFrequency\nSu\nDaily Daily\n1255\nWashington\nIAD\nBA193 BA195 BA189\nT, Th,\nDaily Dailyt Sa*\n1105\n0930\n1345\nNew York\nJFK\n0925 1655\n2155\n1810\nLondon\n2225\nLHR\n1030 1800\n1145\n†From January 3 to March 31 BA195 will operate\ndaily except Saturday.\n*From January 3 to March 31 BA189 will operate on\nSaturdays only. On Tuesday and Thursday BA193 will\ndepart London 1030, arrive NYC 0925, arrive Washington 1125.\nOne of the best investments you can make,\nConcorde will cut your travel time across the\nAtlantic almost in half. Concorde is now\navailable for charter. For complete details\ncontact your local British Airways office.\nAll schedules are subject to change without notice.\nCheck your Traffic Department, Travel Agent or British Airways\nfor the latest fares and schedule information.",
